Z||000000||DXR_DAD||08-18-2001||07:15 PM||||Not sure I want to do this, with all the classifications and names for cars and their drivers that we have had on the forum!! Most of you have seen some of my cars others have seen pics so, I'm Just a car guy I like them all, Imports, old school hot rods, FIEROS! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>TRiAD you can jump in anytime.<P>This is my Del Sol, and yes this is the B18c1<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53090332&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR>The Little Black Toy in front <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53090814&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>Someone said something about the hood clearance?? Not a problem even with a strut tower brace the engine sits nicely. With a Carbon Fiber Hood.<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53090718&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>The web sit that talked about this not being a good swap because of fit ???? they talked about hacking up the fender well for the front mount...I didn't! This is that mount:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53090606&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>Rear mount:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53090647&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>DXR_DAD<P>||||reg||4
