Z||000002||DXR_DAD||08-18-2001||07:55 PM||||Now with all that said,<P>I don't have any # on the HP of the car<BR>Is the car finished?  NO<BR>Did I race Loren's GT? NO  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And the big Question, Is this a <BR>"Del Sloooooow"  I DON'T THINK SO!!!!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53093152&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=53093153&Sequence=1&res=high"> <P>Thanks DXR_DAD||||reg||1
Z||000003||TRiAD||08-18-2001||08:03 PM||||<B>LOL!</B><P>I didn't know you had one of these! Rock on!<P>yeah, someone had found info on the B18C1 NOT fitting in a CRX, and thought since the del Sol was technically a CRX III, that it meant it wouldn't fit in there either. <P>Thanks for shedding some more light on the truth. <P>NICE car!<P>Oh, stock, your engine has 178HP...what mods have you done? Are you on <A HREF="http://www.teamdelsol.com" TARGET=_blank>www.teamdelsol.com</A>  ?<P>Thanks agin, have a good one!<P>~Michael<BR><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Mach10||08-18-2001||08:42 PM||||I have to say it. That carbon fibre hood looks BAD. Ugh.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>The rest is Ok. Kudos to someone who actually made one of these things move  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I love how PACKED that engine bay looks. Lots of KY and a BIG shoehorn, hmm?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I saw a civic CRX with what looked like exactly the same motor. Only this one had the cam covers polished. No, his hood DIDN'T clear it. He had a big chunk lopped out. Looked decent, and his exhaust system actually sounded decent. Oh, that and the thing moved like a rabid mongoose. <P>What do you know? I've seen 2 non-ricer import tuners this week  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
