Z||000010||TRiAD||08-20-2001||04:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pilrulz:<BR><B>just a question, but have you ever considered teg type r cams and a cr-v bottom end? (crvtec)<P>                                pil</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>The B20 is a common question...<BR>It's MUCH easier to do the H22A, which is bigger, already VTEC, and readily available and serviceable. A B20 VTEC conversion is simply re-inventing the wheel, onluy smaller...<P><BR>||||reg||1
